  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Rattlesnake** (1 other source): Included O.N.E. teases, with rattle refrains altered to boogie phrases [1]\n- **Honey** (1 other source): Quoted Rattlesnake, changing rattle refrains to Brussels, plus Sleep Drifter teases [1]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2023-03-20** (recommended): source not stated; 17 songs; 119 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Audience member Mīkal was invited to join the band on stage [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2023-03-20**: taped by Tomcat; transferred by Twenty8; source: Edirol R-09HD with internal mics [1]. Also: Recorded with Edirol R-09HD internal mics, processed via Audacity, Reaper, and CDWave [1]",
